Perform commissioning with custom SCF and achieve On Air
    [Documentation]  Performs commissioning with provided custom SCF then waits for onAir state.
    ...              Custom SCF file can be uploaded by providing full absolute path under custom_scf_name parameter
    ...              including xml extension or just filename if file is stored in testline's custom SCF directory.
    ...              If optical_switch_settings is provided, then optical switch will be set to given position
    ...              before commissioning and alarms related to RMOD connection will be allowed and disallowed afterwards.
    ...
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              - custom_scf_name (str): name of custom SCF file (without .xml extension) for this testline from
    ...                                       gears repository or full path to custom SCF file, e.g.:
    ...                                       /home/ute/my_custom_scf/config_files/custom_scf.xml   or
    ...                                       SCF_SISOAUTO024_8562_8990_10890_SBTS_master
    ...              - bts_type (str): type of BTS, GNB or ENB; defaults to GNB
    ...              - use_proxy (bool): whether to use connection via LTE VM; defaults to False
    ...              - optical_switch_settings (dict): dictionary containing optical switch settings with keys:
    ...                                                optical_switch_id, module_number, output_channel.
    ...                                                Given values should be integers.
    ...                                                If None, then optical switch settings will not be changed;
    ...                                                defaults to None
    ...              - oran_plugin_versions (dict): dictionary containing custom O-RAN plugin versions to install on RMODs,
    ...                                             where key is RMOD product code (string) and value is plugin version (string),
    ...                                             e.g. {'475701A.103': 'RFMPlugin_O-RU_NK_475701A-103_0017'}
    [Arguments]      ${custom_scf_name}
    ...              ${bts_type}=GNB
    ...              ${use_proxy}=${False}
    ...              ${optical_switch_settings}=${None}
    ...              ${oran_plugin_versions}=${None}
    ${is_full_scf_path}=                       scf.is_full_path_to_scf
    ...                                        scf=${custom_scf_name}

    IF                                         """${optical_switch_settings}"""!="""None"""
        Alarms.Allow alarm                     fault_id=10
        ...                                    fault_name=No connection to unit
        Alarms.Allow alarm                     fault_id=1815
        ...                                    fault_name=Not able to synchronize baseband bus
        Alarms.Allow alarm                     fault_id=2002
        ...                                    fault_name=Receiving failure in Optical Interface

        Set Optical Switches Positions         optical_switch_settings=${optical_switch_settings}
    END

    IF                                         """${is_full_scf_path}"""=="""True"""
        Perform Commissioning                  bts_type=${bts_type}
        ...                                    use_proxy=${use_proxy}
        ...                                    scf_file_path=${custom_scf_name}
        ...                                    oran_plugin_versions=${oran_plugin_versions}
    ELSE
        Perform Commissioning                  bts_type=${bts_type}
        ...                                    use_proxy=${use_proxy}
        ...                                    custom_scf_name=${custom_scf_name}
        ...                                    oran_plugin_versions=${oran_plugin_versions}
    END

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer    10m
    ...                                        20s
    ...                                        Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                        bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                        use_proxy=${use_proxy}

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer    10m
    ...                                        20s
    ...                                        Check X2 link status
    ...                                        bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                        expected_state=available

    Disallow X2 Link Alarms
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                      fault_id=4420
    ...                                        fault_name=GPS receiver alarm: firmware upgrade ongoing
    ...                                        bts_type=${bts_type}

    IF                                         """${optical_switch_settings}"""!="""None"""
        Alarms.Disallow alarm                  fault_id=10
        ...                                    fault_name=No connection to unit
        Alarms.Disallow alarm                  fault_id=1815
        ...                                    fault_name=Not able to synchronize baseband bus
        Alarms.Disallow alarm                  fault_id=2002
        ...                                    fault_name=Receiving failure in Optical Interface
    END


