Handle fault 23
    [Arguments]                                ${bts_type}=GNB
    ...                                        ${fault_4153_present}=${False}

    ${connection}                              conn.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                        bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${fault_23_present}                        Alarms.Check if fault 23 is active
    ...                                        bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${rfsw_match}                              Run keyword if    '${bts_type}'=='GNB'
    ...                                        sw_guard.compare_rus_sw_version
    ...                                        connection=${connection}
    ...                                        raise_exception=${False}
    ...                                        ELSE
    ...                                        sw_guard.compare_enb_rus_sw_version
    ...                                        connection=${connection}
    ...                                        raise_exception=${False}

    Run keyword if                             ${fault_23_present} or not ${rfsw_match}
    ...                                        Update software and achieve OnAir
    ...                                        bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                        fault_4153_present=${fault_4153_present}

    Confirm RFSW Compatibility                 bts_type=${bts_type}

Handle fault 23 on LTE and achieve On Air if possible
    Create admin session with default alias    bts_type=ENB
    ${fault_4153_present}                      Alarms.Check if fault 4153 is active on LTE SMOD
    Handle fault 23                            bts_type=ENB
    ...                                        fault_4153_present=${fault_4153_present}

    ${connection}                              conn.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                        bts_type=ENB

    ${rmod_ids}                                admin_info_model.get_rmod_indexes
    ...                                        connection=${connection}

    ${is_any_rmod_shared}                      admin_info_model.is_any_rmod_shared
    ...                                        connection=${connection}
    ...                                        rmod_ids=${rmod_ids}

    run keyword if                             not ${is_any_rmod_shared}
    ...                                        timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer
    ...                                        10m
    ...                                        20s
    ...                                        status_check.verify_statuses_of_all_rmods
    ...                                        connection=${connection}

    run keyword if                             not ${fault_4153_present} and not ${is_any_rmod_shared}
    ...                                        timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer    10m    20s
    ...                                        Check statuses of all cells
    ...                                        connection=${connection}
    Robot Log Step                             Verifying ENB BTS state..

    run keyword if                             not ${is_any_rmod_shared}
    ...                                        timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer    5m   20s
    ...                                        Verify BTS states
    ...                                        bts_type=ENB

    Robot Log Result                           Commissioning procedure on eNB has finished.
    run keyword if                             ${fault_4153_present}
    ...                                        Robot Log Operation  LTE Site Reset is required because of fault 4153

    Alarms.Disallow alarm                      fault_id=23
    ...                                        bts_type=ENB


Return To Initial SCF Configuration
