Check If O-RAN RMODs Are Present
    [Documentation]  Checks if O-RAN RMODs are present in SCF.
    [Arguments]      ${scf_path}
    ${rmods_with_protocol}=                    scf.get_rmods_ran_protocol_from_scf
    ...                                        scf_path=${scf_path}
    ${oran_rmods}                              Evaluate  [k for k, v in $rmods_with_protocol.items() if v == "O-RAN"]
    [Return]                                   ${oran_rmods}


Initialize O-RAN RMODs after commissioning
    [Documentation]  Initializes O-RAN RMODs after commissioning. In general, all of the above steps are required to
    ...              properly detect RMODs using the O-RAN protocol in WebM.
    ...              If custom plugin version is defined for particular rmod's product name under custom_plugin_versions argument,
    ...              it will be used instead of the latest one from WFT.
    [Arguments]      ${rmod_ids}
    ...              ${bts_type}=GNB
    ...              ${custom_plugin_versions}=${None}

    Robot Log Operation                        Initializing O-RAN RMODs after commissioning...
    ${connection}                              conn.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                        bts_type=${bts_type}


    Allow RMOD O-RAN 4278 Module Unauthorized Alarm
    ...                                        rmod_ids=${rmod_ids}
    ...                                        bts_type=${bts_type}
    Configure Netconf SSH Account              connection=${connection}
    Verify O-RAN RMODs After Netconf Configuration
    ...                                        rmod_ids=${rmod_ids}
    ...                                        connection=${connection}
    ...                                        bts_type=${bts_type}
    Download And Activate RMOD O-RAN Plugin    rmod_ids=${rmod_ids}
    ...                                        connection=${connection}
    ...                                        custom_plugin_versions=${custom_plugin_versions}
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                      fault_id=4278
    ...                                        fault_name=Module unauthorized
    Download And Activate RMOD O-RAN SW Package
    ...                                        rmod_ids=${rmod_ids}
    ...                                        connection=${connection}
    ...                                        bts_type=${bts_type}
    Robot Log Operation                        O-RAN RMODs have been successfully initialized.


Configure Netconf SSH Account
    [Documentation]  Configures Netconf SSH account for O-RAN RMODs.
    ...              Path in WebM, Security -> Netconf Radio Management -> Netconf SSH
    [Arguments]      ${connection}

    ${default_account}                         Create Dictionary  defaultNetconfAccountName=nkoranuser
    ...                                                           defaultNetconfAccountPwd=FZYYERJkStMK7LQWwjHerkbldhO03LPb47NQtkftbm9Z
    ${netconf_account}                         Evaluate           [{"id": "SSDORU-1", "defaultNetconfAccount": $default_account}]
    admin.configure_netconf_accounts           unsecure_ciphering=${True}
    ...                                        authentication_method=NoAuthentication
    ...                                        accounts=${netconf_account}
    ...                                        connection=${connection}


Verify O-RAN RMODs After Netconf Configuration
    [Documentation]  Verifies O-RAN RMODs after Netconf configuration.
    ...              RMODs should be detected in WebM with:
    ...              - detected with name 'FR'
    ...              - Status; Operational state: disabled, Availability status: failed, Administrative state: Unlocked
    ...                        Usage state: Idle, Procedural status: not initialized
    ...              - active fault: fault id: 4278, fault name: Module unauthorized
    [Arguments]      ${rmod_ids}
    ...              ${connection}
    ...              ${bts_type}=GNB

    FOR  ${rmod_id}                          IN    @{rmod_ids}
        ${is_rmod_enabled}=                  Run Keyword And Return Status
        ...                                  status_check.verify_specific_statuses_for_specific_rmods
        ...                                  connection=${connection}
        ...                                  rmod_ids=${rmod_id}
        ...                                  operational_state=enabled

        IF  ${is_rmod_enabled}
            Robot Log Result                 O-RAN RMOD ${rmod_id} is enabled.
            CONTINUE
        END

        Wait Until Keyword Succeeds          3min     5 sec
        ...                                  status_check.verify_specific_statuses_for_specific_rmods
        ...                                  connection=${connection}
        ...                                  rmod_ids=${rmod_id}
        ...                                  operational_state=disabled
        ...                                  availability_status=failed
        ...                                  administrative_state=Unlocked
        ...                                  usage_state=Idle
        ...                                  procedural_status=not initialized
        ${rmod_config_dist_name}=            admin_info_model.get_config_distname_for_rmod
        ...                                  connection=${connection}
        ...                                  config_rmod_id=${rmod_id}
        ${unit_path_for_watchdog}=           admin_info_model.get_config_obj_name
        ...                                  connection=${connection}
        ...                                  configuration_dist_name=${rmod_config_dist_name}
        Wait Until Keyword Succeeds          5min     5 sec
        ...                                  Check if alarm is active
        ...                                  fault_id=4278
        ...                                  alarm_id=7112
        ...                                  fault_name=Module unauthorized
        ...                                  unit_path=${unit_path_for_watchdog}
        ...                                  bts_type=${bts_type}
    END
